{"id":"P085-2","subject":"P","unit":"P085","unitTitle":"2025 ② (5월~8월) · 25.05.24 한전 KPS (G3) (사람인)","set":2,"questions":[{"id":"P085-S2-Q01","number":1,"question":"25.05.24 한전 KPS (G3) (사람인) · 객관식 26번","searchText":" 26\n\n다음과 같은 회로에서 일 때 스위치 을 닫는 경우,\n\n회로에 흐르는 전류 는?\n\n\n\n\n\n     ①          ② \n\n                \n                             ③          ④ \n\n                \n                              \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.24 한전 KPS (G3) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e07-m26","number":26},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e07-m26-q.webp","width":696,"height":831},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e07-m26-e1.webp","width":696,"height":638},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e07-m26-e2.webp","width":678,"height":1057}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P085-S2-Q02","number":2,"question":"25.05.24 한전 KPS (G3) (사람인) · 객관식 27번","searchText":" 27\n\n가공전선로에 사용하는 전선의 구비조건으로 옳은 것은?\n\n ㉠ 도전률이 커야한다.    ㉡ 비중이 커야한다.\n\n ㉢ 허용전류가 커야한다.   ㉣ 잘 휘어져야 한다.\n\n\n\n① ㉠㉡㉢        ② ㉠㉡㉣\n\n③ ㉠㉢㉣        ④ ㉡㉢㉣\n\n⑤ ㉠㉡㉢㉣","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.24 한전 KPS (G3) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e07-m27","number":27},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e07-m27-q.webp","width":696,"height":488},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e07-m27-e1.webp","width":678,"height":642}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P085-S2-Q03","number":3,"question":"25.05.24 한전 KPS (G3) (사람인) · 객관식 28번","searchText":" 28\n\n다음은 복도체 방식에 관한 내용이다. 내용의 빈칸에 알맞\n\n은 것은?\n\n 복도체 방식은 단도체 방식과 비교할 때, 작용 인덕\n\n 턴스가 ( ㉠   ), 작용 정전용량이 ( ㉡   ), 안정도가\n\n    ( ㉢   ).\n\n\n      ㉠       ㉡       ㉢\n\n ①    감소      감소      낮다\n\n ②    감소      증가      낮다\n\n ③    감소      증가      높다\n\n ④    증가      감소      낮다\n\n ⑤    증가      증가      높다","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.24 한전 KPS (G3) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e07-m28","number":28},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e07-m28-q.webp","width":678,"height":782},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e07-m28-e1.webp","width":678,"height":186},{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e07-m28-e2.webp","width":696,"height":861}],"responseType":"multiple","hint":"","sourceRefs":[],"options":[{"text":"1번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"2번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"3번","correct":true,"explanation":""},{"text":"4번","correct":false,"explanation":""},{"text":"5번","correct":false,"explanation":""}]},{"id":"P085-S2-Q04","number":4,"question":"25.05.24 한전 KPS (G3) (사람인) · 객관식 29번","searchText":" 29\n\n3상 3선식 송전선로에서 수전단의 선간전압이 37.5kV,\n\n전류가 180A , 부하역률이 0.8일 때, 전압강하율은?\n\n(단, 선로의 저항은 5Ω, 리액턴스는 35Ω이다.)\n\n①         ② \n③         ④ \n⑤ ","source":{"collection":"2025p2","collectionLabel":"2025 ② (5월~8월)","examLabel":"25.05.24 한전 KPS (G3) (사람인)","originalId":"2025p2-e07-m29","number":29},"questionImage":{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e07-m29-q.webp","width":678,"height":613},"explanationImages":[{"src":"data/question-bank/assets/electric/2025p2-e07-m29-e1.webp","width":696,"height":1023}],